# experiments/submissions2/ is NOT ignored, on purpose. Those controller files are the
# evidence behind every number in leaderboard/ -- with them, anyone can re-score the suite
# and check the published matrix; without them, the leaderboard asks to be taken on trust.
# 200 files at ~6 KB is 1.3 MB, which is nothing next to that.
#
# (It first landed here by accident, because this file named `submissions/` and the directory
# was `submissions2/`. Kept deliberately after looking at what it bought.)
#
# Run RECORDS -- full (t, y, r, u) traces -- are the genuinely bulky artifact and stay out;
# they belong in an HF Dataset. See ROADMAP.md, Distribution.
